{
  "name": "TestReportWritesJunitXml",
  "comment": "Runs a passing fixture via test.run, then test.report with test's setting format='junit'.\nProves the junit branch actually formatted the content (not just that the\nformat setting echoed through): %report!content% carries the <testsuites>\nXML root. Also verifies reportPath points at junit.xml and the file was\nwritten on disk.",
